"LeafSong University on Artona III is a school for the Artonan ruling, wizard class."
"Its entrance exams summon extra staff, since Artonan staff are off duty then."
"Magical help at the exams impresses VIP students and their parents."
"Upper-year students now run exam personnel for extra credit."
"Summoned staff may not associate with examinees outside the exams."
"Summonees sleep on enforced schedules, with knock-out drugs."
"Any infraction of its rule book brings a lifetime ban from it and its affiliates."
"Pay there: 1,700 Argold to be summoned, 5,000 a day for disposal work."
"Its exam labs have seventy-five tables, irradiators and a teleport alcove for disposal."
"Some examiners pass only about thirty percent of examinees."
"It is the alien equivalent of an Ivy League school, on a jungle campus."
"Denial of admission is a serious threat to students, with scholarships at stake."
"Its staff dorm houses tmithans, lortch and humans on separate floors suited to each."
"It keeps a medical team of human Avowed under a head medic for emergencies."
"It puts emergency responders on mandatory mental-health leave and issues merit certificates."
"Its Achievement Society Gala always has thirteen Avowed waiters in class costumes."
